      "final_text": "美国市场：美国股票基本持平（S&P 500持平，纳斯达克指数 -0.2%），等权重标普500指数跑赢市值加权指数近80个基点。大型科技股出现反弹，微软(MSFT)和谷歌(GOOGL)录得上涨，但半导体板块持续承压。美国国债收益率普遍下行（2年期下行1个基点至4.32%，10年期下行3个基点至4.65%，30年期下行3个基点至5.13%）。美元上涨+0.1%，黄金上涨+0.2%，布伦特原油因美伊双方暂停攻击及持续谈判的消息下跌-11%至约$88。",
      "iterations": 1,
      "seg_status": "edited",
      "source_text": "U.S. markets: U.S. equities were flat (S&P 500 flat, Nasdaq -0.2%) as the equal-weight S&P 500 outperformed the cap-weighted by nearly 80bps. Big tech staged a recovery with MSFT and GOOGL gaining though semiconductors continued to see pressure. Treasury yields were mostly lower (2Y -1bps to 4.32%, 10Y -3bps to 4.65%, 30Y -3bps to 5.13%). The dollar was up +0.1%, gold gained +0.2% and Brent fell -11% to ~$88 on news of a pause in attacks between the U.S. and Iran and reports of ongoing talks.",
